{"word":"ἀγοραῖος","uri":"agoraios","senses":[{"word":"ἀγοραῖος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">ἀγοραῖος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ος, ον</span>\n[<span class=\"grec\">ᾰ</span>] de place publique <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> de marché, <span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> dont les images se\ndressent sur la place publique, <span class=\"ital\">épith. de\ncertains dieux</span> (<span class=\"ital\">Zeus, protecteur des\nassemblées,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 46 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eschl.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Eum.</span> <span class=\"refch\">973 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">Hermès, protecteur des marchands,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Eq.</span> <span class=\"refch\">297,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">Athèna, Artémis,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Paus.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">5, 14, 4 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">3, 11,\n9</span>) ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> qui passe son temps sur\nla place publique, <span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> oisif, vagabond,\n<span class=\"ital\">à côté de</span> <span class=\"grec\">κακός,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Eq.</span> <span class=\"refch\">214 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">joint à</span> <span class=\"grec\">πανοῦργος,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ran.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1015 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">à</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">φαῦλοι,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Prot.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">347</span><span class=\"refpb\">e</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> qui fréquente les\nmarchés (acheteur <span class=\"ital\">ou</span> marchand)\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Hell.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">6, 2, 23 ;</span> <span class=\"